  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:340px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absolute Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/bc/TD_RimuruTempest-vol15.png/revision/latest?cb=20231122115247\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"TD RimuruTempest-vol15\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/bc/TD_RimuruTempest-vol15.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20231122115247\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/bc/TD_RimuruTempest-vol15.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20231122115247 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/b/bc/TD_RimuruTempest-vol15.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20231122115247 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"TD RimuruTempest-vol15\" width=\"270\" height=\"384\" data-image-key=\"TD_RimuruTempest-vol15.png\" data-image-name=\"TD RimuruTempest-vol15.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Rimuru Tempest (<i>Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken</i>) can absorb and utilize the traits, forms, and abilities of anything and everything, including sentient creatures, inanimate objects, souls, concepts, and universes, ignoring space-time entirely.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb everything and anything without limit.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"It ate everybody!\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Homer Simpson repeating a line from a movie (The Simpsons)</dd></dl></div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"Give up. You've gone too far, Yuuki. If you do bad things, you’ll need to reflect on your actions, right? At least, you should repent about it. Repent for your foolishness and immaturity while inside my『Imaginary Space』. That’s all I allow you to do\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Rimuru Tempest (<i>Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken</i>)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb everything and anything without limit and utilize it in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Omnipotence\" title=\"Omnipotence\">Omnipotence</a>. Absolute form of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Almighty/Eternal/Meta/Omni/Perfect/Total/True/Ultimate/Unstoppable/Totality Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb any/all concepts, powers, universal definitions, laws, boundaries, and even <a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Manipulation\" title=\"Omni-Manipulation\">Totality</a> itself etc., while removing it from the source, into their body and utilize it in some way.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>All <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Absorption\" title=\"Category:Absorption\">Absorptions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Energy Absorption\">Absolute Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Storage\" title=\"Absolute Storage\">Absolute Storage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Absorption/Absolute\" title=\"Superpower Absorption/Absolute\">Absolute Superpower Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Almighty_Absorbing_Replication\" title=\"Almighty Absorbing Replication\">Almighty Absorbing Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Empowerment\" title=\"Absorption Empowerment\">Absorption Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilative_Evolution\" title=\"Assimilative Evolution\">Assimilative Evolution</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Digestive_Assimilation\" title=\"Digestive Assimilation\">Digestive Assimilation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Concept_Absorption\" title=\"Concept Absorption\">Concept Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Consumptive_Replication\" title=\"Consumptive Replication\">Consumptive Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Eternal_Evolution\" title=\"Eternal Evolution\">Eternal Evolution</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Eternal_Transcendence\" title=\"Eternal Transcendence\">Eternal Transcendence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Infinite_Supply\" title=\"Infinite Supply\">Infinite Supply</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Immunity_Bypassing\" title=\"Absolute Immunity Bypassing\">Absolute Immunity Bypassing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Meta_Space-Time_Absorption\" title=\"Meta Space-Time Absorption\">Meta Space-Time Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Overload_Immunity\" title=\"Overload Immunity\">Overload Immunity</a> (All forms of overloading<b>)</b></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Consumption\" title=\"Reality Consumption\">Reality Consumption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Erasure\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Erasure\">Absolute Erasure</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Total_Erasure\" title=\"Total Erasure\">Total Erasure</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Destruction\" title=\"Absolute Destruction\">Absolute Destruction</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Totality_Collapse\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Totality Collapse\">Totality Collapse</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Invincibility\" title=\"Absolute Invincibility\">Absolute Invincibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Separation\" title=\"Absolute Separation\">Absolute Separation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Replication/Absolute\" title=\"Superpower Replication/Absolute\">Absolute Superpower Replication</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Autopotence\" title=\"Autopotence\">Autopotence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Almighty_Ascension\" title=\"Almighty Ascension\">Almighty Ascension</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Archetype:Anti-God\" title=\"Archetype:Anti-God\">Anti-God</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Complete_Arsenal\" title=\"Complete Arsenal\">Complete Arsenal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Concept_Destruction\" title=\"Concept Destruction\">Concept Destruction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Hunger\" title=\"Cosmic Hunger\">Cosmic Hunger</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dissolution\" title=\"Dissolution\">Dissolution</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Physiology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Eldritch Physiology\">Eldritch Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Irreversible_Destruction\" title=\"Irreversible Destruction\">Irreversible Destruction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Limitation_Transcendence\" title=\"Limitation Transcendence\">Limitation Transcendence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Manipulation/Absolute\" title=\"Superpower Manipulation/Absolute\">Absolute Superpower Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Superpower_Opposition\" title=\"Absolute Superpower Opposition\">Absolute Superpower Opposition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nigh_Omnipotence\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nigh Omnipotence\">Nigh Omnipotence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Obsolescence\" title=\"Obsolescence\">Obsolescence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Manipulation\" title=\"Omni-Manipulation\">Omni-Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Negation\" title=\"Omni-Negation\">Omni-Negation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omnipotence\" title=\"Omnipotence\">Omnipotence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Primordial_Entity_Physiology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Primordial Entity Physiology\">Primordial Entity Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Primordial_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Primordial Force Manipulation\">Primordial Force Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Primordial_Nothingness_Manipulation\" title=\"Primordial Nothingness Manipulation\">Primordial Nothingness Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Adaptation\" title=\"Superior Adaptation\">Superior Adaptation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Totality_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Totality Attack\">Totality Attack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Archetype:Cosmic_Entity/Transcendent\" title=\"Archetype:Cosmic Entity/Transcendent\">Transcendent Cosmic Entity</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Archetype:Cosmic_Entity\" title=\"Archetype:Cosmic Entity\">Cosmic Entity Physiology</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Transcendent_Slime_Physiology\" title=\"Transcendent Slime Physiology\">Transcendent Slime Physiology</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Slime_Mimicry\" title=\"Slime Mimicry\">Slime Mimicry</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Uniqueness\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Uniqueness\">Uniqueness</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Unity\" title=\"Unity\">Unity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Universal_Irreversibility\" title=\"Universal Irreversibility\">Universal Irreversibility</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Universe_Destruction\" title=\"Universe Destruction\">Universe Destruction</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Multiverse_Destruction\" title=\"Multiverse Destruction\">Multiverse Destruction</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Omniverse_Destruction\" title=\"Omniverse Destruction\">Omniverse Destruction</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Pralaya (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Metagaos (<i>Exalted</i>)</li>\n<li>Raven (<i>Future State</i>)</li>\n<li>Divine Presence (<i>I/O</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://marvelcinematicuniverse.fandom.com/wiki/Alioth\">Alioth</a> (<i>Marvel Cinematic Universe</i>)</li>\n<li>Amatsu-Mikaboshi/Chaos King (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Thanos (<i>Marvel Comics</i>); via Astral Regulator</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/new-job\">SCP-682 - Hard-To-Destroy-Reptile</a> <i>(SCP Foundation)</i>; via <a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Adaptation\" title=\"Superior Adaptation\">Superior Adaptation</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://tensura.fandom.com/wiki/Rimuru_Tempest\">Rimuru Tempest</a> (<i>Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"h